     A**********************************************************************
     A* WMCZP - Zip-Code by County (REVERSE-ENGINEERED placeholder)
     A* CHAIN key: (co#, st, zip5) - see wtagtcfg.rpgle line 773
     A**********************************************************************
     A          R PCZ01
     A            CZCO#          3P 0       TEXT('Company Number')
     A            CZST           2A         TEXT('State')
     A            CZZIP          5P 0       TEXT('Zip 5 (numeric)')
     A            CZCNTY        20A         TEXT('County')
     A            CZP            1A         TEXT('Primary flag')
